    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_10",
      "hash64": "EB305BE6A2406AD6",
      "text": "Tu connais Pania ? C’est une fille super douée\\nen technologie. Elle suit le cursus scientifique.\\c\\nÇa faisait un moment qu’on la voyait plus, mais\\nil paraît qu’elle a repris les cours récemment...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_08",
      "hash64": "A478D6916FCE54BB",
      "text": "Moi, mes cours, je les lis à haute voix !\\c\\nÇa aide mes yeux, ma bouche et mes oreilles\\nà s’en souvenir ! C’est la mémoire sensorielle !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_09",
      "hash64": "A478D5916FCE5308",
      "text": "Je me suis inscrite à l’académie pour étudier\\nles Pokémon, mais je me suis aussi découvert\\r\\nune passion pour les sciences !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_11",
      "hash64": "EB305CE6A2406C89",
      "text": "Le type Insecte est super efficace contre le type\\nPlante, car les insectes mangent les plantes !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_12",
      "hash64": "EB3059E6A2406770",
      "text": "Je lui ai posé tellement de questions que le prof\\na retenu mon nom dès le premier jour !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A75C187C419B1996",
      "text": "C’est laquelle qui redonne le plus de PV ?\\nLa Super Potion ou l’Hyper Potion... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A75C1B7C419B1EAF",
      "text": "Tu connais la Team Star ? Ses membres ont\\ncausé des problèmes il y a quelque temps...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_poke_24",
      "hash64": "01B48409590A47B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 76]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "004C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_03",
      "hash64": "4A9BB8FB162BB5D4",
      "text": "Je ne suis pas un professeur, je suis un élève !\\nTu ne vois pas que je porte un uniforme ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_06",
      "hash64": "4A9BB5FB162BB0BB",
      "text": "Les capacités de type Acier sont super efficaces\\ncontre le type Fée... J’ai juste ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_07",
      "hash64": "4A9BB4FB162BAF08",
      "text": "C’est plus dur de trouver les affinités de types\\nd’un Pokémon quand il en a deux...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A75C197C419B1B49",
      "text": "Je suis contente de pouvoir suivre les cours\\ndu soir, ça me permet de travailler la journée.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A75C1A7C419B1CFC",
      "text": "Y a pas assez d’heures dans une journée, alors\\nje rattrape en faisant des nuits blanches...\\r\\n... que je regrette dès le lendemain !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A75C1D7C419B2215",
      "text": "J’ai trouvé une pièce. C’est un Pokémon qui l’a\\nfait tomber.\\c\\nJe l’ai mise de côté pour la lui rendre, mais il est\\nsi petit que je n’arrive plus à le retrouver...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
